## Summary

Self-taught engineer, 11 years and 15+ contracts. From zero to 20M-session platforms; from side hustle to profitable product. Led teams, shipped PCI-compliant payment systems, and built AI features that save hours of work daily.

I think in business outcomes first: revenue, risk, cost, and time to market.

